{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "b1f4e2a0-9c3d-4e8f-a7b6-5d2c1e0f9a83",
        "name": "The Tiffin Club API",
        "description": "Public store API + Customer (Clerk) API + Admin API, generated from docs/api.md and docs/admin-api.md.\n\n- Base URL: `{{base_url}}` (e.g. `https://thetiffinclub.test/api/v1`).\n- Every response uses the envelope `{ success, message, data }` (errors add `errors: { field: [...] }`).\n- All money amounts are integer **cents** (`1600` = $16.00). All times are `Pacific/Auckland`.\n- Non-production only: send `X-Simulated-Time: <ISO-8601>` to fake \"now\" (echoed back in `X-App-Time-Now`; ignored in production).\n\nWorkflow: run Admin ▸ login first to fill `{{admin_token}}`. Place an order in Public ▸ Create order to fill `{{order_token}}`. Paste a Clerk JWT into `{{clerk_token}}` for the Customer folder.",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "variable": [
        {
            "key": "base_url",
            "value": "http://thetiffinclub.test/api/v1",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "admin_token",
            "value": "",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "clerk_token",
            "value": "",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "order_token",
            "value": "",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "admin_email",
            "value": "staff@admin.com",
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "key": "admin_password",
            "value": "password",
            "type": "string"
        }
    ],
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "Public",
            "description": "Guest-facing endpoints. No auth except optional Bearer on `POST /orders` (authenticated placement).",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Get store settings",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "url": "{{base_url}}/settings",
                        "description": "Public store settings, read-only. `delivery_suburbs` feeds order placement validation (`suburb` must be in this list for delivery). `pickup_map_url` is nullable."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Get today's menu",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "url": "{{base_url}}/menu/today",
                        "description": "Today's published menu plus ordering window. Use `data.ordering.state` (`open` | `opening_later` | `closing_soon` | `closed`) — never compute open/closed client-side. No menu published yet → `{ \"status\": \"coming_soon\", \"main\": null, \"extras\": [] }`."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Create order",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "// Save the manage token — sole handle to view/edit/cancel the order.",
                                    "var body = pm.response.json();",
                                    "if (body.data && body.data.manage_token) {",
                                    "    pm.collectionVariables.set('order_token', body.data.manage_token);",
                                    "}"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"fulfilment\": \"delivery\",\n    \"name\": \"Amol W\",\n    \"email\": \"amol@example.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"0211234567\",\n    \"address\": \"12 Cuba Street\",\n    \"suburb\": \"Te Aro\",\n    \"delivery_notes\": \"Knock twice\",\n    \"items\": [\n        { \"id\": 3, \"quantity\": 2 },\n        { \"id\": 4, \"quantity\": 1 }\n    ]\n}"
                        },
                        "url": "{{base_url}}/orders",
                        "description": "Place a guest order for today's menu → **201**. `manage_token` (64 hex) is only returned here; the test script saves it to `{{order_token}}`.\n\nRules: `name` required; at least one of `email`/`phone`; `suburb` required for delivery and must be in `delivery_suburbs`; `items.*.id` must exist on today's menu, `quantity` 1–20. Errors: 422 (`items.*.id`, `suburb`, `email`, `phone`, `ordering` when window closed).\n\nWith a Bearer (Clerk) token present: payload `email` must match the JWT email (else 422); invalid-but-present token → 401. Initial status is `confirmed` (auto-confirm). Fires a queued confirmation email when the customer has an email."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Lookup order",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"token\": \"{{order_token}}\",\n    \"email\": \"amol@example.com\"\n}"
                        },
                        "url": "{{base_url}}/orders/lookup",
                        "description": "Knowledge-based lookup: manage token + the email or phone used at checkout (matched against the customer's **current** values). `email` and `phone` are interchangeable; at least one required. Every failure (unknown token, expired, wrong contact) answers identically **404** — nothing leaks."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Get order",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "url": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_token}}",
                        "description": "View an order by manage token. **200** order object; **404** unknown token; **410** token expired (past 23:59:59 on the order day)."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Update order",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "PATCH",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"fulfilment\": \"pickup\",\n    \"delivery_notes\": \"Leave at door\",\n    \"items\": [\n        { \"id\": 3, \"quantity\": 1 }\n    ]\n}"
                        },
                        "url": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_token}}",
                        "description": "Edit before cutoff. All fields `sometimes`; applied fields are `fulfilment`, `delivery_notes`, `items` (item ids validated against the order's own menu). Switching to `delivery` does **not** re-validate suburb — validate client-side against `GET /settings`. Errors: 422 (validation / off-menu / after cutoff with `ordering`), 410 expired.\n\nKnown gap: request still *accepts* `name`/`address`/`suburb` (validated then silently ignored); `email`/`phone` are rejected."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Cancel order",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "DELETE",
                        "url": "{{base_url}}/orders/{{order_token}}",
                        "description": "Cancel before cutoff → **200** with the order object (`status: \"cancelled\"`). After cutoff only staff may cancel (not exposed here). **410** expired, **404** unknown."
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "Customer (Clerk)",
            "description": "Signed-in customer endpoints. Auth is a Clerk JWT (`Authorization: Bearer {{clerk_token}}`), verified against Clerk's JWKS (issuer, `azp` allow-list, expiry) and must carry `email_verified: true`. The verified email maps to the `customers` row. Missing/invalid token → **401**. Requires `CLERK_ISSUER` and `CLERK_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` in `.env`.",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Get my account",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "bearer",
                            "bearer": [
                                {
                                    "key": "token",
                                    "value": "{{clerk_token}}",
                                    "type": "string"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "method": "GET",
                        "url": "{{base_url}}/my-account",
                        "description": "The signed-in customer. **Creates** the row from the JWT name + email on first request. Returns `name`, `email`, `phone`, `address`, `suburb`."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Update my account",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "bearer",
                            "bearer": [
                                {
                                    "key": "token",
                                    "value": "{{clerk_token}}",
                                    "type": "string"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "method": "PATCH",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Amol W\",\n    \"phone\": \"0211234567\",\n    \"address\": \"12 Cuba Street\",\n    \"suburb\": \"Te Aro\"\n}"
                        },
                        "url": "{{base_url}}/my-account",
                        "description": "Update contact/delivery details. All fields optional (`name`, `phone`, `address`, `suburb`). `suburb` must be in the delivery list; `phone` unique. Invalid → **422**."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Get my orders",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "bearer",
                            "bearer": [
                                {
                                    "key": "token",
                                    "value": "{{clerk_token}}",
                                    "type": "string"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "method": "GET",
                        "url": "{{base_url}}/my-orders",
                        "description": "Every order on the email-matched customer row — guest history included — newest first. No row yet → `data: []` (never creates one)."
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "Admin",
            "description": "Token-authenticated admin SPA API under `/api/v1/admin`. Sanctum personal access tokens; staff email allowlist (`ADMIN_EMAILS`). All money is integer **cents**, both directions. Lists support `?filter[...]=`, `?sort=` (`-` prefix = descending), `?page=`, `?per_page=` (default 15). All resources include `created_at`/`updated_at`.\n\nRun **Login** first — its test script saves `data.token` to `{{admin_token}}`.",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Login",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "// Save the Sanctum token for the other Admin requests.",
                                    "var body = pm.response.json();",
                                    "if (body.data && body.data.token) {",
                                    "    pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_token', body.data.token);",
                                    "}"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}"
                        },
                        "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/login",
                        "description": "Email + password → `{ data: { token: \"1|...\", user: { name, email } } }`. Account must be on the staff allowlist. Rate limited 10/min (429)."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Logout",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "bearer",
                            "bearer": [
                                {
                                    "key": "token",
                                    "value": "{{admin_token}}",
                                    "type": "string"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/logout",
                        "description": "Deletes the current Sanctum token."
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "Orders",
                    "item": [
                        {
                            "name": "List orders",
                            "request": {
                                "auth": {
                                    "type": "bearer",
                                    "bearer": [
                                        {
                                            "key": "token",
                                            "value": "{{admin_token}}",
                                            "type": "string"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                "method": "GET",
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/orders?filter[status]=confirmed&sort=-placed_at&page=1&per_page=15",
                                    "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                                    "path": ["admin", "orders"],
                                    "query": [
                                        {
                                            "key": "filter[status]",
                                            "value": "confirmed",
                                            "description": "Filters: status, fulfilment, customer_id, menu_id"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "key": "sort",
                                            "value": "-placed_at",
                                            "description": "Sorts: placed_at, total. Default -placed_at"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "key": "page",
                                            "value": "1"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "key": "per_page",
                                            "value": "15",
                                            "description": "Default 15"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                "description": "Paginated list (`data: { resource, links, meta }`); includes customer + payments (with `paid` sum)."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Get order",
                            "request": {
                                "auth": {
                                    "type": "bearer",
                                    "bearer": [
                                        {
                                            "key": "token",
                                            "value": "{{admin_token}}",
                                            "type": "string"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                "method": "GET",
                                "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/orders/1",
                                "description": "Single order; includes items, payments, customer."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Update order status",
                            "request": {
                                "auth": {
                                    "type": "bearer",
                                    "bearer": [
                                        {
                                            "key": "token",
                                            "value": "{{admin_token}}",
                                            "type": "string"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                "method": "PATCH",
                                "header": [
                                    {
                                        "key": "Content-Type",
                                        "value": "application/json"
                                    }
                                ],
                                "body": {
                                    "mode": "raw",
                                    "raw": "{\n    \"status\": \"ready_for_pickup\"\n}"
                                },
                                "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/orders/1",
                                "description": "Status only. Valid: `confirmed`, `ready_for_pickup`, `out_for_delivery`, `completed`, `cancelled`. 422 if cancelling an order with a recorded paid sum > 0 (payments are immutable — ADR 0002). Order contents are immutable. Writes an audit entry (`status_changed`, actor `staff`)."
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "Payments",
                    "item": [
                        {
                            "name": "List payments",
                            "request": {
                                "auth": {
                                    "type": "bearer",
                                    "bearer": [
                                        {
                                            "key": "token",
                                            "value": "{{admin_token}}",
                                            "type": "string"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                "method": "GET",
                                "url": {
                                    "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/payments?filter[order_id]=1&sort=-paid_at",
                                    "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                                    "path": ["admin", "payments"],
                                    "query": [
                                        {
                                            "key": "filter[order_id]",
                                            "value": "1",
                                            "description": "Filters: method, order_id, customer_id"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "key": "sort",
                                            "value": "-paid_at",
                                            "description": "Sorts: paid_at, amount. Default -paid_at"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                "description": "Paginated payment list."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Record payment",
                            "request": {
                                "auth": {
